                <li className="flex items-start gap-3"><span className="mt-1 shrink-0 w-5 h-5 rounded-full bg-primary/10 flex items-center justify-center text-primary text-xs font-bold">1</span><span className="text-neutral-700">Nursing judgment under pressure is hard to fake — past behavior on a real unit is the best predictor.</span></li>
